  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>3,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is one end of the focal chord <math> <mrow> <mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow> </math> of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1,</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> then the slope of the normal at <math> <mi>Q</mi> </math> is"
  },
